WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
BUILD 036. OFFLINE IS A PRODUCT STATE—NOT AN ERROR PAGE. Essential work needs a deliberate mode for disconnection, partial service, stale data, queued actions, conflict, and recovery.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
BOUND ESSENTIAL WORK. WHAT MUST STILL BE POSSIBLE?. Name critical tasks, minimum evidence, local data, prohibited actions, human fallback, expiry, dependencies, and the consequence of delay.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
ENTER RESILIENCE MODE. DETECT · EXPLAIN · LIMIT · CONTINUE. Make network state, freshness, unavailable features, safe capabilities, queued work, support, and stop conditions explicit.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
PROTECT LOCAL STATE. MINIMIZE · ENCRYPT · VERSION · EXPIRE. Store only what is necessary, preserve provenance and accessibility, prevent silent overwrite, and make device loss and shared-device risk visible.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
RECOVER WITH EVIDENCE. RECONNECT · COMPARE · RESOLVE · CONFIRM. Revalidate identity and freshness, detect conflicts and duplicates, require accountable resolution, sync safely, and record the resulting state.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
SAVE THIS. FAIL SAFELY. RECOVER TRUTHFULLY.. RESILIENCE IS NOT STAYING ONLINE. IT IS FAILING SAFELY AND RECOVERING TRUTHFULLY.

